  triage:description "quality-mgr independently reproduced a `just lint` RULE-002 (function-length) FAIL on PR #850 (feature/an2-sprint @ 6aed4d7d352ef3f6f1efde04a71e419cb486cb17): crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/shared_db.rs lines 589-677, function `ensure_mail_message_columns` (89 lines), overlapping the diff vs origin/develop. quality-mgr verified this is PRE-EXISTING by reproducing the identical violation (lines 639-727, same 89-line length) on the fix commit's direct parent 3572e2e73 (before the AN2QA1-FIX-1 5-file fix diff) — i.e. it originates from the earlier AN.2 feature commit 7dd8c71c3, not from the fix round, and simply moved line numbers when shared_db.rs was partially decomposed in the fix round. Currently blocking merge of PR #850 since `just lint` must be green." ;
